plant mono_swap    : red ['MONO'], reason NOT_BELOW -> FIRES
plant step_identity: red ['STEP'], reason NO_STRICT_STEP -> FIRES
plant ray_below    : red ['RAY'], reason BELOW_BOUND -> FIRES
plant votes_noshadow: red ['VOTES'], reason LAW_BROKEN -> FIRES
plant anti_half    : red ['ANTI'], reason NO_IN_VOTE -> FIRES
faithful run: red [] -> PASS
  MONO : IDENTITY     f(x) - x = -x^2/(1+x), ft(x) - x = x^2/(1-x); f(x) < x < ft(x) at -5/6, -1/3, 1/7, 2/3
  STEP : STRICT_STEP  1191 admissible quadruples on the grid j/6; each has lam or ups strictly increasing, neither decreasing
  RAY  : BOUND_HOLDS  ft^k(x) >= -1/(k+1) on [-1, 0), f^k(x) <= 1/(k+1) on (0, 1], k <= 20; equality at x = -1 (the pencil)
  VOTES: LAW_HOLDS    12 case rows: at a failing leaving centre, inside allows only s_in colours, outside only s_out colours
  ANTI : IN_VOTE      42 (arc, antipodal pair) cases: every arc votes 'in' at one antipode at least; unit arcs vote 0 exactly on their own circle
